'''Sunrise Doge''' (日の出わんこ, ''Hinode Wanko'', '''Sunrise Doggy''') is a [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy that appears in [[Special Events|Event Stages]]. It was added in [[Version 3.2 Update|Version 3.2]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Sunrise Doge
|image = E 126.png
|appearance = [[Year's First Dawn]]<br>
[[A Colossal New Year!]]<br>
[[A Colossal New Year! (2023)]]
|money drop = 2,015¢ - 7,959¢
}}

==Enemy==
A [[Doge]]-faced Sun that represents the dawn of a new year. This stationary [[:Category:Metal Enemies|Metal]] enemy has a very long attack range and despite its low damage, can cause some serious trouble with its 2-second [[Freeze|freeze]].

==Strategy==
This animated enemy base really only poses a threat in [[A Colossal New Year! (2024)|A Colossal New Year!]], in which the freeze it poses can cause the [[Snache Doge]]s to easily push through your meatshields and get to your attackers by the time they are no longer frozen. To prevent this, cats that are [[:Category:Cats with Freeze Immunity|immune to freeze]] help a lot, especially if they are attackers. In the other stages Sunrise Doge appears in, it doesn't pose a threat in the slightest other then wasting your time if you didn't bring a [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|critical hitter]].

