==Trivia==
*This enemy is tied with [[Filibuster Obstructa]] and [[Metafilibuster (Enemy)|Metafilibuster]] for the second-longest range in the game, the first being [[Shin Godzilla]].
*Sunrise Doge was updated to be [[Immune to Surge]] and [[Immune to Warp|Warp]] at an unknown date, retroactively becoming the first enemy to have these immunities.
*This enemy is based off a [https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Sun_dog Sun dog], also called a mock sun or parhelion, which is an atmospheric optical phenomenon appearing as bright, sometimes colored spots of light, to the left and/or right of the sun

